NOTE ON QUOTED MATERIAL

This repository quotes passages from public agency documents (MTA New York City
Transit statutory noise reduction reports, the Brooklyn Bridge Park Final
Environmental Impact Statement, the NYC CEQR Technical Manual, FTA Report 0123,
and N.Y. Public Authorities Law) and from published journalism and research.
Those passages remain the property of their respective authors and publishers
and are reproduced here for scholarly commentary, criticism and research under
fair use. Each is delimited, attributed, and carries a verification state in
Part 14 of IDEA-CONCEPT.md.
